   "gameId": "sklime-a-difficult-climbing-adventure-322528",
   "displayName": "Small update - New emotes, private lobbies, bug fixes, advanced haptics",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-07-26T20:50:04.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "-DualSense® wireless controller now has more detailed haptic feedback when playing the game in wired mode (You can disable this in the controls section of the options menu to use the standard haptics instead)",
