      {
       "text": "-A sparkle emote and a scared emote have been added to dpad up and dpad down",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-You can now invite players to your specific lobby, and create a lobby restricted to friends, you can join a different lobby is weel in the multiplayer section of the pause menu",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Various bugfixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
